- 📱 Events panel relegated to desktop-only (hidden on mobile to save space)
- 📱 Auto-collapsing sidebar when chat selection occurs on mobile
- 📱 Proper visual hierarchy maintained across all breakpoints

All changes maintain full desktop functionality while providing an optimized mobile experience for screens < 768px (tablet breakpoint).

